1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:13,437
Genetic engineering means taking a gene out of one organism, joining it in a test tube to a carrier DNA, and putting it into a living cell, which then gains a trait that no amount of breeding could give it.

2
00:00:13,437 --> 00:00:19,557
Because the joined DNA combines two sources, it is called recombinant DNA.

